 "about": "Komamura rework (pass kr, KOMAMURA_REWORK_2026-11-14): every file of Reworks/Komamura that a launch installs, with its game path; launcher/komamura_rework.py refuses a file that is not these bytes. Script/ and Motion/ go over the version's mirror; Overlay/ goes through the launcher's overlay pairs (stock backed up, put back when the switch is OFF); Plugin/ is installed by the launch step while ON only (never from Files/Matchmaking/Plugins). steam_path false: a path the Steam game does not have -- a launch with the switch OFF removes it when it holds these bytes, and while ON its launch registers it in Fnames/file_exist.htable. same_as_steam: built, but byte-identical to the Steam file, so not shipped.",
